Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:09.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:11.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My tooth is kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.82,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:20.95,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:26.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your adult tooth is growing in, so just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:29.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to eat porridge instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.67,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be fine if I chew slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:24.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:34.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's the one I drew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.84,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, it's always your dad who comes here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.59,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He's not my dad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.10,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.97,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Rin-chan is the best at drawing in Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:05.76,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You could become a manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:07.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:09.69,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You could!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.30,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.61,Usaghi Main,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.89,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:29.63,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This good-looking guy is a dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:31.22,Usaghi Main Top,girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:32.37,Usaghi Main Top,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he great?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:34.14,Usaghi Main Top,girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's so tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:37.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Sayaka-san's dad is 31, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:39.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:43.36,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so? What a happy coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My papa is a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.91,0:03:52.51,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey now, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:56.70,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little when I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:02.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think I might've seen you in our company's catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:04.92,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:10.20,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Could you tell me the name of that company?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.21,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Then it's probably me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.93,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm very grateful towards them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.77,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What a carefree guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:21.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manager for the same agency now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.61,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Both the working hours and pay were pretty unpredictable,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.61,0:04:30.95,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,so I quit after my daughter was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:38.22,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Around that time, I'd be drinking and complaining about work all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:40.52,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Miki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.91,0:04:43.24,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Nabe-chin! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:46.42,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,He's a classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:47.91,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,We grew up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:50.91,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,He has a son in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.88,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,This is Rin-chan's dad, Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.31,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:58.52,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:04.71,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,These people are already at the parenting stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:05.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.21,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:13.94,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,On the corner of the shopping district.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:16.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin and I buy croquettes there all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:19.23,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Happy to hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:20.30,Usaghi Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.89,Usaghi Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:32.43,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just became friends with some dads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:04.85,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In a way, the world seems a bit bigger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:12.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.12,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:17.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten cold all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.28,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:21.23,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like the kids have already gone to P.E.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:23.55,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I hope they're wearing their jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:24.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:28.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.57,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he put a lot of effort into{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,all the other kids are at P.E already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.01,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.54,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:46.36,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,The teacher's going to yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:48.41,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Boys sure can be a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:50.60,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.50,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,How old?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.07,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Almost 10 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:57.91,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Babies are so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.65,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,This brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:07.36,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,You know, my kid got the flu last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:08.21,Usaghi Main Top,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to make you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:08.98,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.15,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Must be troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:11.64,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's that season already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.36,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,They need to stay home for two days even after the fever subsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:15.54,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,They're still contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:19.67,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I sent my kid to school right after the fever went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:23.93,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's unavoidable. You'd get fired from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:28.43,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was pretty much gone anyway, so the virus would be weak too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.21,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.88,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Even if someone did catch the flu, no one would know who it was from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:39.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.13,0:07:49.51,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:54.08,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I kind of understand where those people were coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:57.49,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm just a bit depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:01.96,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,The talk about their jobs and such. I sort of understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:08.53,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,When it starts to get cold, I get so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:10.34,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:13.30,Usaghi Main I,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and get into your pajamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:19.73,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,But once winter ends, and it starts to get warm again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.99,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I can finally breathe a sigh of relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.93,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:33.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, give me a minute to get my schoolbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:35.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:36.81,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:39.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you to put your jackets on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And don't run in the hallways!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.43,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No running, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki is already losing his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.85,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we live in an apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.72,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,he doesn't listen and throws them onto the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:58.55,TL Note,Note,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: Baby teeth are thrown onto the roof as a charm to make the new teeth grow properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.55,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, he hasn't been listening to a word I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the right to talk about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wearing as little clothing as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Running down the stairs two at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eating really fast and gulping down the milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:16.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It feels really weird to warn kids not to do the things I did as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.31,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, you used to do all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:22.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's pretty normal for a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:25.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I can't think of Kouki as a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:28.98,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:32.51,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,But if you were like that too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:34.83,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a bit relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:45.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Why don't you walk with Kouki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:46.47,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:49.83,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's split up the guys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:50.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.90,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't Rin-chan's face a little red?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.45,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan probably has a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.62,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It might get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:13.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot more flushed than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.51,Usaghi Main,doc,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't appear to be the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.39,Usaghi Main,doc,0000,0000,0000,,I'd advise members of the family to wear a mask, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:31.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:49.95,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. This part feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said it's a stomach infection, so no need to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:57.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:01.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,L-Let me get a washbowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:24.70,Usaghi Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is {\i1}what{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.70,Usaghi Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Call an ambulance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I already had her checked out and got some medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but she refuses to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps increasing, and she looks like she's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.20,Usaghi Main I,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you let her go out wearing light clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares about that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:40.80,Usaghi Main I,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Mix the medicine with some juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.43,Usaghi Main I,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You'd drink it right away if I mixed it with something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:48.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:00.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:03.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:09.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.84,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to come by so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.83,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,How's Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.36,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:47.34,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, what's with that hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:46.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.61,0:12:52.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the flu, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, go watch some TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:56.69,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:57.86,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Keep the volume down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:03.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She finally fell asleep earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The fever just keeps going up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:13.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and she has trouble sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She isn't sweating at all, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:17.44,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Did you give her any fluids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:22.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was told to at least give her sports drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't drink or eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:26.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.40,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You can't lose your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:40.62,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,An adult has to stay calm and tell them they'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:42.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen Rin like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:47.93,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:53.89,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,When they're in trouble, kids really depend on others to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:01.52,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan will be fine as long as you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.86,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.83,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.84,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to eat some ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.60,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.10,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I had to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.28,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:47.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:53.06,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You can have some more ice after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:56.26,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,If you eat too much at once, you'll upset your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:57.75,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:06.09,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I just put something sweet and delicious in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:07.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:17.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I made you late for work, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.72,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is trying really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.20,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you're there for her, she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:30.84,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I might have to take tomorrow off too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:42.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please give me a call if something comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.61,Usaghi Main I,phone,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:49.78,Usaghi Main I,phone,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?\NJust leave everything to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want to eat a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:06.56,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Once you're better, you can eat all the sweets you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.82,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:29.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:39.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just sleep a little more, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:41.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.10,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to be Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:51.98,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If it were me, it wouldn't have been so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:55.63,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:17.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:19.97,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.10,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:32.81,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,How are you feeling, Rin-chan? Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:35.77,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:39.70,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you some tasty porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.13,0:17:59.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever has been going up again since the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:03.80,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. Fevers tend to go down in the morning and go back up in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But it went above 39 degrees earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:09.83,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Here! Put this in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:11.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.39,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:27.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.45,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,There's enough for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:44.60,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, Rin wants some water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:53.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, stay here so you don't catch anything from her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.90,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I do, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:58.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:09.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:21.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:24.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin feels a lot more relaxed when you're here, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:34.43,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Rin-chan. Want to eat a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:38.30,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:41.55,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki eats this when he gets sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.90,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's a special porridge that'll make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:52.35,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. When he eats this, he gets better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:29.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.95,0:20:31.12,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:33.96,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.48,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.39,0:22:29.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tell your mom I really appreciated her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:34.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She took care of Rin, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:38.49,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Can I go home with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.31,0:22:43.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to go home with your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:48.29,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom's in bed with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.29,0:22:50.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Seriously?
